estaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","review_id":"H2lUQCLOOkw39OvuL_mj8g","date":"2014-05-20T16:05:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9340542554855347,"text_excerpt":"There is a coffee place closer to my house than this but I prefer to walk the extra couple of blocks to get here. Everything is good and of course, so is the coffee. The baristas are naturally nice there. Their friendliness isn't canned or over-the-top, they're just genuinely friendly people so it's a nice atmosphere to be in. I think I'm gonna go get a coffee now. :)"},{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","review_id":"9Td8_1f_aIZqZ5AhKMI5Qw","date":"2016-05-18T22:51:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9296952486038208,"text_excerpt":"I love this place and work out of it fairly often. It's legit, original hipster...no chalk board motivational quotes, repurposed milk churns or Mustang headlights turned in to light fixtures. Instead, the furniture is vintage 80's (although the screws holding the tables together might be older, they're somewhat rickety) and the décor, in the backroom at least, is questionable. The yellow paint on the walls is luminous to make up for the lack of windows. Trim is orange (also luminous) and grey (not luminous) and in no way matches the laminate floor or the 80's furniture. Anyway, don't go to a coffee shop for the furniture or the décor*, go for the chat with the staff and the coffee. Here, ..."},{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","review_id":"Jz54bKmDrUYgFPFL6LIrpw","date":"2011-09-03T01:20:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9277878999710083,"text_excerpt":"This is a great local coffee shop. In my opinion, the best thing about this place is that it offers DELICIOUS vegan pastries, other vegetarian and vegan offerings of food, and really knows how to make a soymilk-based coffee drink. The free internet and worn-in feel of the place make it a great office-away-from-home whenever I need to do some work, get away from the house (or office), and have a delicious treat in a friendly place. Love it!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","photo_id":"Gw2gMH9UodVxFYTIPQ3VJw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Gw2gMH9UodVxFYTIPQ3VJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9032343029975891},{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","photo_id":"IOVcjsW2TVpaY00v8ialhA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IOVcjsW2TVpaY00v8ialhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8848804831504822},{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","photo_id":"F_D4kbhn1GkfrXNUwvYeGA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F_D4kbhn1GkfrXNUwvYeGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8714607954025269},{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","photo_id":"g26JiNPS-RR-6UHOX1BrOA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/g26JiNPS-RR-6UHOX1BrOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8451465368270874},{"business_id":"ujYhU3bX35BCVj1NUbSQpQ","photo_id":"bMNOu98c8L6whwLdNUorCg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bMNOu98c8L6whwLdNUorCg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7337343692779541}]},"notebook_case":null}
